@end

@article
    @title=list test
    @key=listtest
    @ingroup=index
    @brief=

    >>  Tricky formatting

    This is **Bold** and __italic__ text.
    We can also do ^^superscript^^ or
    <http://www.google.com> simple links.

    We can also kind of **__mix__ tags**

    [b]Simple list[/b]

    * Item 1
    * Item 2

    * Item 3
    * Item 4

    [b]Multiple list[/b]

    * Item 1
      And item 1
      And Item1

    * Item 2

    - Item Other Kind

    * Item 3
    * Item 4

    Numbered list!

    # My number list
    * And item
    * And...
      multiline item
    - and Last item

    Here we should stop

    * and `this` should go to a new list


@end


@article
    @title=table test
    @key=tabletest
    @ingroup=index
    @brief=

    >> Simple Table
    |C1,1|C1,2|C1,3|
    |C2,1|C2,2|C2,3|
    |C3,1|C3,2|C3,3|
    >> Header
    |!,C1,1|C1,2|C1,3|
    |C2,1|C2,2|C2,3|
    |C3,1|C3,2|C3,3|
    >> width
    |50%,C1,1|C1,2|C1,3|
    |C2,1|C2,2|C2,3|
    |C3,1|C3,2|C3,3|
    >> header
    |!,C1,1|C1,2|C1,3|
    |C2,1|C2,2|C2,3|
    |C3,1|C3,2|C3,3|
    >> header and width
    |!50%,C1,1|10%,C1,2|C1,3|
    |C2,1|C2,2|C2,3|
    |C3,1|C3,2|C3,3|
    >> header and width and 100%
    |!50%,C1,1|10%,C1,2|C1,3|>
    |C2,1|C2,2|C2,3|
    |C3,1|C3,2|C3,3|
@end